Rāma asks why Lakṣmaṇa left trusted Sītā --- Lakṣmaṇa says Sītā heard false rescue cry --- Lakṣmaṇa says he reassured Sītā fearlessly --- Sītā accuses Lakṣmaṇa of lusting and betrayal --- Sītā says Lakṣmaṇa follows at Bharata bidding --- Lakṣmaṇa leaves hut red-eyed with trembling lip --- Rāma says slain Mārīca mimicked his voice --- Rāma condemns leaving Maithilī on angry words